        `Deadlift or trap-bar deadlift — ${p.sets} sets x ${p.reps}`,
        `Lat pulldown or assisted pull-up — ${p.sets} sets x ${p.reps}`,
        `Shoulder press — ${p.sets} sets x ${p.reps}`,
        `Bulgarian split squat — ${p.sets} sets x ${p.reps} each side`,
