          `Push-up or dumbbell press — ${p.sets} sets x ${p.reps}`,
          `Romanian deadlift — ${p.sets} sets x ${p.reps}`,
          `One-arm row — ${p.sets} sets x ${p.reps} each side`,
          `Loaded carry or plank — ${p.sets} sets x 30–45 sec`,
